   "en": "Dragon First Crush"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "As soon as Lou reached adulthood, he begged his father to send him to the magic school. There Lou fell in love at first sight with Ian, the second prince of Peloders, and Ian too somewhat felt attracted to Lou, but... Lou is actually a child of a dragon who was murdered long back by the current Emporer of Peloders and Ian came to the school to learn magic about hunting dragons…\nCan both of them express their affection to each other while hiding their secrets?\n\nBased on the web novel of the same name, “Dragon’s First Crush’’."
